        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b><br></b></div><ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp; A Convenient Addition to a Wellness Routine: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the things that makes BreathiZen work in real life is its spray form. While for some grown-ups, swallowing capsules might be a little tricky, a spray might just become an easier way to add it to one’s daily schedule. A regular practice might help to remember taking this kind of a supplement too. However, the convenience of something does not mean a specific health result will be achieved.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">A Blend of Botanical Ingredients:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;BreathiZen contains mullein leaf extract, ginger root extract, bromelain, organic lemon extract, and Cordyceps militaris. These ingredients have different backgrounds and uses in foods, traditional practices, or dietary supplements. Having them together may appeal to consumers who prefer botanical formulas. However, it is important to check the quantity of each ingredient and avoid assuming that the combination has been clinically proven to improve breathing.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>An Option for Adults Who Prefer Spray Supplements: </b>Not everyone enjoys taking tablets or capsules every day. BreathiZen's oral spray format provides another option for adults who prefer a liquid-style supplement. Before using it, consumers should check the serving instructions, storage recommendations, and complete list of ingredients. Anyone who has difficulty swallowing medication or has a health condition should still ask a healthcare professional about suitable options.</span></li><li><b>Encourages More Attention to Respiratory Wellness: </b>Exploring a product such as BreathiZen is an occasion to reflect upon lifestyle factors that influence the health of consumers in their day-to-day life. Avoiding smoking and dust, leading an active life whenever possible, and complying with doctors' recommendations are some actions that might prove to be beneficial. On the other hand, it is not possible to confirm that the product called BreathiZen may help treat problems of respiratory nature.</li><li><b>&nbsp;A Formula Consumers Can Research Before Buying: </b>The listing of ingredients on BreathiZen makes it easy for consumers to begin comprehending what the supplement contains. Understanding each individual ingredient, considering any allergic reactions that may occur, and looking at the label will ensure that consumers have enough information. It is reasonable to look at the pricing of the supplement and its servings compared to those of other supplements as well. Understanding the formula itself is better than making generalized assumptions based on marketing.</li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content8-2t",
          "_cid": "vxy3cl4Dby",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
